{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/1113732-ic-innocents-through-darkness","id":1113732,"title":"[IC] [Innocents] Through Darkness","path":["Home","Onyx Path","General","Conventions, Gatherings, and Online Play","Play by Post"],"posts":[{"date":"2017-07-09T07:42:45-07:00","id":1113732,"title":"[IC] [Innocents] Through Darkness","content":"<u><b>The Strange in Town</b></u><br /> <br /> <b>Billy, Jay</b><br /> It's late autumn in the small town of Solemn Falls, and the kids have grown tired of complaining about the start of the school year. Your three characters live far enough from school that you take the bus each day, and each of you end up on the same bus along the way. It's a dry and chilly Wednesday, with the sun drunkenly rising off in the distance. <br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> When Sean's picked up.... </div> </div> </div><b>Everyone</b><br /> The bus begins rolling away from your bus stop before you\u2019ve taken your seats, causing you to lurch your way towards the back. Glancing back over your shoulder, you see Groucho\u2019s eyes in the rearview mirror, those steely blue orbs demanding that you find a place to sit immediately. You do so, your breath hanging on the air, your eyes looking out onto the passing landscape, taking it in with the sure knowledge that you\u2019ll be in a classroom for several hours that will seem like an eternity. <br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Who did their homework last night? If you're behind on work, are you going to attempt to finish it during the bus ride? </div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12742-doggo","name":"Doggo","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12742_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"36"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-11T05:42:35-07:00","id":1114542,"title":"","content":"Billy's wearing a common outfit, well-pressed corduroy pants, a nice button-down shirt, and subdued tennis shoes. His glasses, chunky plastic frames, fall slightly down his nose as the bus lurches forward. He, as always, has done all of his homework. So he opens a fairly thick book for a 12 year-old, and begins reading.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13549-thehouse","name":"TheHouse","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"8"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-12T04:46:27-07:00","id":1115025,"title":"","content":"Jay takes the lurch with a grin and an exaggerated &quot;woaaaah&quot; before plopping down into the nearest available seat on the left. She is dressed in jeans and a red t shirt with the &quot;UFC&quot; logo in bold letters on the front and back. She lets her eyes wander with her mind around the bus, any thought of actually finishing her homework getting buried with each observation.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13584-horace-tabor","name":"Horace Tabor","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13584_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"20"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-13T11:18:38-07:00","id":1115605,"title":"","content":"Sean is every bit the model student. His dark brown hair is combed neatly to the side, his features awake and vigilant. He was wearing dark pants and a white shirt, looking prim and proper and in prime condition. He took a seat and gazed out of the window.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12561-shawarbaaz","name":"Shawarbaaz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12561_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"467"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-14T09:13:20-07:00","id":1115974,"title":"","content":"<b>Everyone</b><br /> All of the kids on the bus glance towards Groucho as the bus begins to slow down. The realization dawns quickly: it\u2019s a new bus stop! The students look out of the right window, some dashing across the aisle to get a better view. The first thing you notice is the old Mayfair House, a massive, dark affair that seems more like a crouching gray frog than a home. Dwarfed by the house\u2019s shadow you see him: The new kid. The doors squeak open, and you hear his light footsteps on the stairs before his head appears at the far end of the aisle. He is small and frail, with thick glasses, short hair and no chin to speak of. He has obviously been dressed by his parents, wearing a collared shirt tucked into brown slacks that looks like something your parents might wear. Clutched in his hand is an old copy of The Danger Brothers, a set of stories about two brothers who solve mysteries through logic. As the bus pulls away, you glance back at the Mayfair House. You can\u2019t shake the feeling that you are being watched. <br /> <br /> ((What do you do?))","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12742-doggo","name":"Doggo","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12742_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"36"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-15T14:10:16-07:00","id":1116551,"title":"","content":"Sean keeps a clear and decides to logically deduct who exactly is watching him, if anyone (roll Investigation + Intelligence)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12561-shawarbaaz","name":"Shawarbaaz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12561_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"467"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-15T15:13:20-07:00","id":1116573,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Shawarbaaz</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/1113732-ic-innocents-through-darkness?p=1116551#post1116551\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Sean keeps a clear and decides to logically deduct who exactly is watching him, if anyone (roll Investigation + Intelligence)</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Are you asking to see who is watching your character, or the other kid?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12742-doggo","name":"Doggo","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12742_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"36"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-15T15:32:22-07:00","id":1116579,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Doggo</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/1113732-ic-innocents-through-darkness?p=1116573#post1116573\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <br /> Are you asking to see who is watching your character, or the other kid?</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Sean wants to know why is he feeling watched, by scanning the environment.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12561-shawarbaaz","name":"Shawarbaaz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12561_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"467"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-16T17:19:20-07:00","id":1117014,"title":"","content":"One of the kids sitting behind the new child leans forward. &quot;What's that old book? Why can't you read something cool?&quot; He laughs and smacks the new kid upside the head. That draws several snickers from others in surrounding seats.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12742-doggo","name":"Doggo","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12742_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"36"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-16T21:45:06-07:00","id":1117090,"title":"","content":"Billy glances over at the new kid, strangely feeling somewhat of a kindred spirit. He, luckily, sits just a seat behind him in the other aisle. &quot;Hey, what's, um, your name?&quot; He asks, barely audible.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13549-thehouse","name":"TheHouse","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"8"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-17T12:42:56-07:00","id":1117377,"title":"","content":"Jay watches the house until it fades from view before shifting her focus to the new arrival. Upon seeing him being hit from behind she calls out &quot;Hey, cheap shot!&quot; in the hope of getting the jerk's attention. The new kid seems like a creep, but his tormentors seem like some good fun.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13584-horace-tabor","name":"Horace Tabor","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13584_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"20"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-17T17:52:45-07:00","id":1117518,"title":"","content":"Sean watches the other kids, seemingly amused but otherwise indifferent. He's more concerned with this omnious feeling of being watched, something definitely doesn't add up.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12561-shawarbaaz","name":"Shawarbaaz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12561_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"467"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-18T08:54:55-07:00","id":1117778,"title":"","content":"<b>Billy</b><br /> While the kids nearby are focusing on Jay, the new kid brushes a hand through his dirty blonde hair. He says back, with a stammer, &quot;My name's Bradley. What's yours?&quot; <br /> <br /> <b>Jay</b><br /> The rowdy kids turn to you. One of them, a preppy-looking boy with cropped brown hair and a smooth face, quirks his mouth. &quot;If bust your nose would you call that a cheap shot, too? Or maybe you're just covering up because you can't fight.&quot; Some of the other kids chuckle. You know this kid. This is Max Cooper, the boy that wears expensive shirts and fine slacks. Visually, he stands out from the other with his confident, hard jaw and wiry musculature. <br /> <br /> <b>Sean</b><br /> Your eyes fall on the new boy, and you notice another boy speaking to him. The new kid is pressed against the window, as if he's trying to get uninvolved with the kids around him. He mouths something to the other boy, Billy, and then lowers his head. <br /> <br /> ((What do you do?))","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12742-doggo","name":"Doggo","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12742_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"36"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-18T12:33:51-07:00","id":1117886,"title":"","content":"Sean studies the new kid, making the assumption that the kid comes from a traditionalist, conservative family. He might have been sheltered from the outside world, which explains his confused and meek demeanor. He is intrigued, and would like to learn more about the nerdy new kid.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12561-shawarbaaz","name":"Shawarbaaz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12561_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"467"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-20T04:35:49-07:00","id":1118481,"title":"","content":"Jay makes eye contact with Max, with a grin she replies&quot;If you could even land a hit I'd call it luck, not that'd help you once I took your ass to the ground. Heck, I'd be surprised if you'd even come at someone you knew would fight back.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13584-horace-tabor","name":"Horace Tabor","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13584_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"20"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-20T08:19:07-07:00","id":1118566,"title":"","content":"<b>Everyone</b><br /> <br /> \u201cStop!\u201d Bradley yells, sudden and shrill. The bus strikes a bump, sending you bouncing out of your seat... when there is an almost deafening burst of noise. The bus lurches sickeningly sideways, the scream of other kids mixes with the screech of brakes and tires against pavement, and then the bus slams into the far side of a ditch. There is a moment of silence as the smell of rubber hangs in the air. Kids\u2019 heads pop up from behind vinyl seats and peer wide-eyed at one another. Eventually they all fall on the same person: the new kid. <br /> <br /> You and the other children are herded off of the crashed bus. It is like a long, dull yellow box, front end buried in the sodden dirt of the ditch. Groucho scowls as he waves off a gaggling group of girls. Bradley sits alone on the ground, ten feet from you all. A half hour later, another bus rolls up, picks you up, and takes you to school, arriving a bit late for your first room. <br /> <br /> The next four hours are uneventful, and recess in the afternoon comes. The crisp air of the fall grounds, its smell of dull sweet grass and rotting leaves reaching your nose, is a contrast to the waxy smell of the school's halls. <br /> <br /> You manage to break away from the rest of the kids during recess. Their questions and opinions have been incessant this morning. Whispered words between desks, notes passed when the teacher\u2019s back was turned. A quick glance about ensures you that nobody\u2019s near.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12742-doggo","name":"Doggo","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12742_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"36"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-24T16:06:40-07:00","id":1120118,"title":"","content":"Abigail, who wasn't much of a talker unless she was spinning stories, didn't even hesitate once they were finally free for recess. Those last few hours had <i>dragged</i>, and she'd had so much time to just imagine all the possibilities. The girl immediately made a bee-line for the new kid, keeping her voice down as she glanced to see who else was nearby. &quot;What didja see?&quot; she asked breathlessly, fingers fidgeting with her brown braid of hair, blue eyes bright with interest. &quot;You did see somethin', right?&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13129-gossamer","name":"Gossamer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13129_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"18"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-24T16:53:51-07:00","id":1120139,"title":"","content":"Bradley looks up at you from his seat on three car tires buried halfway in the dirt. He shrugs. &quot;Everybody was getting so loud. I wanted them to stop. I didn't expect the bus to crash. That was scary.&quot; <br /> <br /> He slouches further into his seat and takes off his wire-frame glasses, beginning to wipe the lenses. Not looking at you, he bores his gaze forward into the wall.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12742-doggo","name":"Doggo","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12742_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"36"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-24T17:30:44-07:00","id":1120158,"title":"","content":"&quot;Oh,&quot; she said. But her brow was furrowed, lips twisted into a pout, eyeing the new kid still. There was something clearly skeptical in her eyes. &quot;Really? That was it?&quot; And there was disappointment there, as well, her shoulders slumping.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13129-gossamer","name":"Gossamer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13129_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"18"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-26T15:48:56-07:00","id":1121057,"title":"","content":"Jay had been listening silently to their exchange, admittedly a little shaken by the morning's accident but no less intrigued for it. &quot; You think their loudness made it stop?&quot; She asked, eyebrow raised at his strange way of putting it. &quot;Or it stopped because you wanted it to? That's crazy talk!&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13584-horace-tabor","name":"Horace Tabor","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13584_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"20"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-28T07:53:36-07:00","id":1121843,"title":"","content":"Bradley looks put off by your insinuations. &quot;Cant we change the subject?&quot; <br /> <br /> A beat. Then you hear giggling from behind you, and turning around, you see Max and two of his hangers-on approaching. Max is staring past you and his gaze is pinned on Bradley. <br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12742-doggo","name":"Doggo","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12742_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"36"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-28T08:17:55-07:00","id":1121861,"title":"","content":"Abby rolled her eyes at Jay, crossing her arms as she looked at the other girl. &quot;That's not what he was saying--&quot; she started, shaking her head. <br /> <br /> But she heard that giggling and looked back at Max, eyeing him as he and his buddies approached. This probably wasn't gonna be good. And Abby's lips were moving before she had a chance to even think about it, a story just pouring out. It was like second nature to her. &quot;Good thing he stopped the bus this morning, right? Or else we totally would've hit that big dog. He was <i>ginormous</i>. Or maybe it was a wolf. D'ya think it was a wolf?&quot; she went on, looking back at Jay and Bradley. &quot;That would've been cool if it was a wolf.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13129-gossamer","name":"Gossamer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13129_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"18"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-03T07:42:21-07:00","id":1124296,"title":"","content":"Jay turns to face the approaching crew, assuming a confident pose. &quot;Yeah, prolly just a coyote though, honestly.&quot; She replies, distractedly.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13584-horace-tabor","name":"Horace Tabor","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13584_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"20"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}